WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.450
Your work email isn't always in one inbox.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.010
And Outlook add-ins aren't always available.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.630
But your accounts are already in Outlook.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.710
ReplyPort connects Outlook to the AI you already use.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:18.640
Ask a question, and your AI searches every mailbox you've enabled.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.350
Ask for a reply, and a real draft appears in the right Outlook account.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.190
Nothing sends automatically.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.870
You review. You send.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.050
ReplyPort. AI for the Outlook accounts you already have.
